{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd/app.bsky.feed.post/3lktdushazs2x","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd","uri":"at://did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd/app.bsky.feed.post/3lktdushazs2x","cid":"bafyreidytx4okwbf4ni77edvp6kbhhpa74m74gukkz76tgazurf5bcnvva","auteur_did":"did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/vincentcaure.bsky.social/post/3lktdushazs2x","date":"2025-03-20T18:39:33.547Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-03-20T18:39:34.049Z","text":"Nous sommes 321 millions! 🇫🇷\n\nEn cette journée internationale de la #francophonie, je veux saluer le travail des lycées français, associations FLAM et Alliances françaises qui œuvrent à la promotion de notre langue en Europe du Nord.","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"francophonie"}],"index":{"byteEnd":88,"byteStart":75}}],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
